# Repository and Room

All chat I/O goes through `ChatRepository` / `ChatRepositoryImpl`. DAOs and `AppDatabase` are not used from ViewModels or Compose.

Map `*Entity` → domain `Chat` / `Message` before leaving the repository. Domain models use `val` fields.

```kotlin
// BAD — Entity in a ViewModel
val rows: StateFlow<List<MessageEntity>>

// GOOD
val messages: StateFlow<List<Message>>
```

Before changing repository or network logic, read `ChatRepositoryImpl.kt`.
